      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 13,
      "title": "Return shape change breaks both CLI callers",
      "description": "safeGit now resolves to an object, but currentBranch at branch.ts:7 and changedFiles at status.ts:7 still treat it as a string. Neither caller is updated in this change. changedFiles throws a TypeError on out.split for every run, so main.ts crashes. currentBranch catches its TypeError and returns null, so main.ts reports not a git repository inside every repository. Update both callers to read result.stdout, and check result.code where the old throw was relied on. Alternatively keep the string return and add the structured variant as a new function.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
