      "title": "Swallowed git failure defeats the null check in currentBranch",
      "description": "safeGit no longer throws on a failing command. currentBranch in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:5 relies on that throw to return null outside a repository. Once the callers read stdout, currentBranch returns an empty string instead of null outside a repository. main.ts then skips its not a git repository exit and runs changedFiles against a non-repository. Have callers check result.code and treat a non-zero code as failure. Alternatively keep a throwing variant for callers that depend on the exception.",
